[{"id":"ultimate_combat:class_feature:gunslinger_deeds","label":"Deeds","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"Gunslingers spend grit points to accomplish deeds. Most deeds grant the gunslinger some momentary bonus or effect, but there are some that provide longerlasting effects. Some deeds stay in effect as long as the gunslinger has at least 1 grit point. The following is the list of base gunslinger deeds. A gunslinger can only perform deeds of her level or lower. Unless otherwise noted, a deed can be performed multiple successive times, as long as the appropriate amount of grit is spent to perform the deed."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"\nA gun tank swaps a pair of deeds for the following - Gun Tank's Resolve, Gun Tank's Resilience."}],"applies":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_combat:class_feature:gunslinger_archetype_gun_tank"},"count":1}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"\nA musket master swaps a pair of deeds for the following. - Steady Aim, Fast Musket."}],"applies":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_combat:class_feature:gunslinger_archetype_musket_master"},"count":1}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"\nA mysterious stranger swaps a pair of deeds for the following - Focused Aim, Clipping Shot."}],"applies":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_combat:class_feature:gunslinger_archetype_mysterious_stranger"},"count":1}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"\nA pistolero swaps a trio of deeds for the following - Up Close and Deadly, Deadeye, Twin Shot Knockdown."}],"applies":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_combat:class_feature:gunslinger_archetype_pistolero"},"count":1}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"\nA gun tank swaps a pair of deeds for the following - Gun Tank's Resolve,